[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-nc6 3.e3"]
[Name "2...Nc6 and 3...e6"]

3... e6 { Black shuts in the c8 bishop, so there is no ...Bf5 or ...Bg4 to worry about. }
4. Nf3
4... Bd6
5. Bg3 { Keeps the bishop, whatever the move order. }
5... Nf6
6. Nbd2 { The same position as after 3...Nf6 4.Nf3 e6 5.Nbd2 Bd6 6.Bg3. } *
